{"id":"b22a6e1e78d533a6","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-mixing.md","title":"Mixing","display":"df-mixing — Mixing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-mixing","aliases":["58-df-mixing"],"display":"df-mixing — Mixing","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-iteration.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-mixing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-mixing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mixing — Mixing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"785c80475c01fc69\" href=\"?note=785c80475c01fc69\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md\">../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdcaf927aa04d82b\" href=\"?note=bdcaf927aa04d82b\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-iteration.md\">../batch17/58-df-iteration.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal B,\\mu,T)\">\\((X,\\mathcal B,\\mu,T)\\)</span> (动力系统参数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S\\)</span> (保测度谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"785c80475c01fc69\" href=\"?note=785c80475c01fc69\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md\">../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span> (有限函数迭代, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bdcaf927aa04d82b\" href=\"?note=bdcaf927aa04d82b\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-iteration.md\">../batch17/58-df-iteration.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mixing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Mixing}_S\\)</span> (defined here; mixing predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mixing} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mixing}_S(T;X,\\mathcal B,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal B)\\land\\mu(X)=1\n\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(N\\leq n\\to\n\\left|\\mu\\bigl((T^n)^{-1}[A]\\cap B\\bigr)-\\mu(A)\\mu(B)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mixing} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mixing}_S(T;X,\\mathcal B,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal B)\\land\\mu(X)=1\n\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(N\\leq n\\to\n\\left|\\mu\\bigl((T^n)^{-1}[A]\\cap B\\bigr)-\\mu(A)\\mu(B)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mixing implies asymptotic independence.</li>\n<li>极限已展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>–<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 条件，并复用有限迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span>，不再把未来源的极限算子或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{-n}\">\\(T^{-n}\\)</span> 当作原语。</li>\n<li>It is stronger than ergodicity.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md","status":"resolved","id":"785c80475c01fc69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-iteration.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdcaf927aa04d82b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-iteration.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md","status":"resolved","id":"785c80475c01fc69","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S$ (保测度谓词, see [[../batch11/58-df-measure-preserving.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-iteration.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdcaf927aa04d82b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T^n$ (有限函数迭代, see [[../batch17/58-df-iteration.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal B,\\mu,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mixing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mixing} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Mixing}_S(T;X,\\mathcal B,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasPreserving}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal B)\\land\\mu(X)=1\n\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(N\\leq n\\to\n\\left|\\mu\\bigl((T^n)^{-1}[A]\\cap B\\bigr)-\\mu(A)\\mu(B)\\right|<\\varepsilon\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"T^{-n}","display":false}],"bytes":1174,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-850","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-mixing.md|58-df-mixing]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["785c80475c01fc69","bdcaf927aa04d82b"]}